# Every file in this repository is text, and every one of them is LF.
#
# Without this, git on Windows checks out CRLF by default, and then gofmt
# reports every Go file as unformatted. The CI run on windows-latest did
# exactly that: fifty-two files listed, none of them actually changed.
#
# It matters for more than gofmt. The recorded corpora and the session
# transcripts are compared byte for byte, so a line ending rewritten on
# checkout would fail tests that are right, on the one platform least able
# to explain why.
* text=auto eol=lf
